      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "considering that the VRChat privacy system allows you to \"hide\" avatars or block those who annoy you, unfortunately the user cannot do much to avoid certain behaviors by others. I'm new to VRChat and I've met some very helpful people in small communities and rooms where they warned me about these users, but despite the Setup of the settings and the right procedures I had problems from Crasher and those who insulted just for fun..",
