      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have been subjected to death threats several times.\n\nStalking and user crashers.\n\nI'm tired of these people not being punished.\n\nThe biggest problem is that I'm not the only one who suffers all this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
