  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-01-16T10:10:28.800Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We are fed up and we need to find a remedy for these people.\n\nI'm referring to all the people who don't mind being banned or blocked because they have nothing to lose \"projects or avatars\".\n\nThey use multiple accounts and enter public rooms to disrupt small communities.\n\nWhether they are Crasher users who enter, damage the community and leave undisturbed.\n\nThat they are harassers of users, especially girls.\n\nWhether they are bullies who practice Cyberbullying, making death threats and stalking in real life.\n\nYou MUST find a system now! For these people.\n\nLimit accounts, find a way to identify who generates new accounts, and prevent such occurrences.",
